========================================================================
: NOTEBOOK SOURCES :
========================================================================
This place is served as official (and last) list of notes and notebooks
on lore. It is tool for organising sources via codes, so it is clear
which source adds to which part of lore, and how accurate it is.
------------------------------------------------------------------------
NAMING:
          [TYPE, one letter].[Number, separate per type]:[Name]

Categories:
L - Land   (notebook containing area visualisation)
D - Data   (notebook containing info about areas, incl. Lands variant of it)*
I - Info   (notebook containing lore sources, e.g. book contents, item list)
M - Map    (paper containing map)
P - Loose  (paper of other lore sources, e.g. item list, calendarium, lang)
V - Varied (non-Baedoor-aimed notebook, but with a bit of Baedoor included)

* if possible, should follow numbering of L, so L/D of the same number
  connect to each other (if not found, take vacant number of both)
